---
description: Investigate the requested migration issue through current native evidence and focused placement/caller reasoning.
args:
  goal: string
  assignment: PanelMigrationAssignment
returns: '{ observed: MigrationObservation; assessment: MigrationFinding }'
---
Read the current assigned migration. Use the existing private planning hierarchy where helpful to assess the user's question or work. Relate the actual destination kind, stable source/build identity, working callers and current reviewed authority to the goal. Distinguish facts about the currently live panel from facts about the proposed destination. Return the actual observation and a supported assessment. No operation is implied by this investigation.
